<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_appendix"><a href="#A10" title="In Streaming Drag-Oriented Interactive Video Manipulation: Drag Anything, Anytime!" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">J </span>Drag-Style Operation Types</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_appendix"><a href="#A11" title="In Streaming Drag-Oriented Interactive Video Manipulation: Drag Anything, Anytime!" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">K </span>Why Need Context Frames?</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_appendix"><a href="#A12" title="In Streaming Drag-Oriented Interactive Video Manipulation: Drag Anything, Anytime!" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">L </span>Additional Video Results in Supplementary Materials</span></a></li>
</ol></nav>
